# UI Design System & Theming

## Color Scheme
- **Primary**: Green (#4CAF50) - Used for buttons, progress bars, active states
- **Secondary**: Orange (#FF9800) - Used for accents and highlights
- **Background**: Dark (#121212) - Main app background
- **Surface**: Dark gray (#1E1E1E) - Card and component backgrounds
- **Surface Variant**: Lighter gray (#2D2D2D) - Secondary card backgrounds
- **On Surface**: White - Text on dark backgrounds
- **On Surface Variant**: Light gray (#B3B3B3) - Secondary text

## Typography
- Use Material Design 3 typography scale
- **Title Large**: 22sp, Bold - Section headers
- **Title Medium**: 18sp, Bold - Card titles
- **Body Large**: 16sp, Normal - Main content
- **Body Medium**: 14sp, Normal - Secondary content
- **Label Medium**: 12sp, Medium - Small labels

## Component Guidelines
- Use `RoundedCornerShape(16.dp)` for main cards
- Use `RoundedCornerShape(12.dp)` for smaller components
- Use `CircleShape` for profile pictures and icons
- Implement proper spacing with `Spacer` and `Arrangement.spacedBy()`

## Theme Implementation
- Theme file: [Theme.kt](mdc:app/src/main/java/com/pawgram/app/ui/theme/Theme.kt)
- Typography: [Type.kt](mdc:app/src/main/java/com/pawgram/app/ui/theme/Type.kt)
- Apply theme using `PawgramTheme` wrapper

## Navigation
- Custom bottom navigation with circular indicators
- Active state uses primary color background
- Inactive state uses transparent background with gray icons

